meta {
  name: saveCategory
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveCategory",
    "params": {
      "product_category_name": "Cables"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Create or update a product category

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `product_category_id` | integer (nullable) | no | ID of the category to update; omit to create a new category |
  | `super_category_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Super-category this category belongs to (required when creating) |
  | `parent_category_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Parent category ID; omit for a root-level category within the super-category |
  | `product_category_code` | string (nullable) | no | Short code for the category, unique within its super-category (max 50 characters) |
  | `category_name` | string (nullable) | no | Display name of the category in the given language (requires language) |
  | `language` | string (nullable) | no | BCP 47 language code for category_name (e.g. nl-NL); required when category_name is set |

  **Example: Create a category**. Omit product_category_id to create; provide it to update. Use super_category_id to nest under a parent.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveCategory",
    "params": {
      "product_category_name": "Cables"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_category_id": 7
  }
  ```
}
